---
import Quote from '@talks/shared/components/Quote.astro';
import SlideShell from '@talks/shared/components/SlideShell.astro';
---
<div class="slide">
  <SlideShell number="11" total="19" label="Capa 3" />
  <h2 class="title">MCP — <em>Model Context Protocol</em></h2>

  <p class="body" style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:16px;">
    El estándar abierto que conecta al agente con el mundo. <strong>El USB del agente.</strong>
  </p>

  <div class="mcp-diagram">
    <div class="mcp-center">
      <div style="font-size:1.8rem;">🤖</div>
      <div class="mcp-label">Agente</div>
    </div>
    <div class="mcp-connector">
      <div class="mcp-badge">MCP</div>
    </div>
    <div class="mcp-tools">
      <div class="mcp-tool">
        <span>📁</span><span>GitHub</span>
      </div>
      <div class="mcp-tool">
        <span>💬</span><span>Slack</span>
      </div>
      <div class="mcp-tool">
        <span>📋</span><span>Notion</span>
      </div>
      <div class="mcp-tool">
        <span>🗄️</span><span>Supabase</span>
      </div>
      <div class="mcp-tool">
        <span>📅</span><span>Google Cal</span>
      </div>
      <div class="mcp-tool">
        <span>🌐</span><span>Web Search</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <Quote author="Anthropic, 2024 — estándar open source adoptado por toda la industria" style="margin-top:16px;">
    Si existe como herramienta digital, hay un MCP para que tu agente la use.
  </Quote>
</div>

<style>
/* ══ SLIDE 11 — MCP ══ */
.mcp-diagram {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 0;
  margin: 8px auto 0;
}
.mcp-center {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 6px;
  background: rgba(0,232,122,0.06);
  border: 2px solid rgba(0,232,122,0.35);
  border-radius: 12px;
  padding: 16px 20px;
  min-width: 90px;
}
.mcp-label { font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 0.76rem; color: var(--green); letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; }
.mcp-connector {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  padding: 0 12px;
  position: relative;
}
.mcp-connector::before {
  content: '';
  display: block;
  width: 60px;
  height: 2px;
  background: linear-gradient(to right, var(--green2), rgba(0,232,122,0.3));
}
.mcp-badge {
  position: absolute;
  left: 50%;
  transform: translateX(-50%);
  background: rgba(0,232,122,0.15);
  border: 1px solid rgba(0,232,122,0.4);
  border-radius: 4px;
  padding: 3px 8px;
  font-family: var(--font-m);
  font-size: 0.74rem;
  color: var(--green);
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  white-space: nowrap;
}
.mcp-tools {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 8px;
}
.mcp-tool {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
  background: rgba(15,35,24,0.7);
  border: 1px solid rgba(0,232,122,0.1);
  border-radius: 6px;
  padding: 8px 12px;
  font-family: var(--font-m);
  font-size: 0.85rem;
  color: var(--muted);
}

@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .mcp-diagram { flex-direction: column; }
  .mcp-connector { padding: 10px 0; }
  .mcp-connector::before { width: 2px; height: 36px; }
  .mcp-badge { top: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); }
}
</style>
